a slice before the NUL: the program holds 1, C reads 1
a slice after the NUL: the program holds 1, C reads 1
the first character: the program holds 1, C reads 1
a join of one part: the program holds 1, C reads 1
a number: the program holds 5, C reads 5
the empty text: the program holds 0, C reads 0
clean texts joined: the program holds 2, C reads 2
